AI MODELS
---------

Gemma 4 (E2B / E4B / 26B MoE / 31B Dense)
  Owner:    Google LLC / Google DeepMind
  License:  Apache License 2.0 (per the official release, April 2026)
  Source:   https://ai.google.dev/gemma
            https://huggingface.co/google
  Notice:   RukiAI ships NO Gemma weights. The model is downloaded by the
            operator via `ollama pull gemma4:e2b`. Use of the model is
            subject to Google's licensing and any acceptable-use policy
            applicable to it at the time of download.

nomic-embed-text
  Owner:    Nomic AI
  License:  Apache License 2.0
  Source:   https://huggingface.co/nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5
  Notice:   Used as the default RAG embedding model. Pulled at runtime via
            Ollama; not redistributed in this repository.

OPTIONAL CLOUD PROVIDERS
------------------------

If a user opts in via /dashboard/settings, RukiAI calls one of the
following hosted APIs with that user's own API key. RukiAI itself does not
distribute, embed, or modify any of these services or models — it is only
a client. Use is subject to each provider's terms of service.

  - Google Gemini             https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/terms
  - OpenAI                    https://openai.com/policies
  - Anthropic Claude          https://www.anthropic.com/legal
  - Cohere                    https://cohere.com/terms

RUNTIME / TOOLING
-----------------

Ollama
  Owner:    Ollama, Inc.
  License:  MIT License
  Source:   https://github.com/ollama/ollama
  Notice:   Required external service for the default local AI provider.
            Installed by the operator; not bundled with RukiAI.

KEY OPEN-SOURCE DEPENDENCIES
----------------------------

The Python and JavaScript packages listed in `backend/requirements.txt`
and `frontend/package.json` are used under their respective open-source
licenses. A non-exhaustive summary:

  Backend (Python)
    - FastAPI                 MIT       https://github.com/tiangolo/fastapi
    - Beanie                  Apache-2  https://github.com/BeanieODM/beanie
    - Pydantic / pydantic-settings   MIT
    - Motor / PyMongo         Apache-2  https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/
    - python-jose             MIT
    - passlib + bcrypt        BSD / Apache-2
    - httpx                   BSD-3-Clause
    - aiosmtplib              MIT
    - uvicorn                 BSD-3-Clause

  Frontend (JavaScript / TypeScript)
    - React                   MIT
    - Vite                    MIT
    - TanStack Router / Query MIT
    - TypeScript              Apache-2
    - Tailwind CSS            MIT
    - lucide-react            ISC
    - Radix UI primitives     MIT

  Database
    - MongoDB Community Server  Server Side Public License (SSPL) v1
                                — used as an external service; not bundled

For the authoritative license text of each package, see its source repository
or the corresponding `LICENSE` file in your installed `node_modules` /
`site-packages` tree.

